{"output":"I’ll inspect job transitions and lock renewal, fix the ownership checks, then build and run the specified tests with Node 24.\n\nThe Lua scripts checked only whether a lock existed, not whether its token matched the worker’s. I restored token checks for transitions and both renewal paths, preserved the administrative token bypass, and moved delayed-job promotion after retry ownership validation so rejected retries cannot emit events.\n\nThe build and four new recovery regression tests pass. They check stale completion, failure, both retry paths, lock renewal, unchanged stored state and events, and successful completion by the replacement owner. The seven-file existing suite is still running.\n\nFixed Lua ownership checks for job transitions and single/batch lock renewal. Rejected retries no longer promote delayed jobs. Administrative bypass remains intact.\n\nNode 24 verification passed:\n- npm run build\n- Your exact regression command: 268 tests\n- Added ownership suite: 4 tests\n- git diff --check\n\nAll commands exited 0. No existing tests or configuration changed.","final_output":"Fixed Lua ownership checks for job transitions and single/batch lock renewal. Rejected retries no longer promote delayed jobs. Administrative bypass remains intact.\n\nNode 24 verification passed:\n- npm run build\n- Your exact regression command: 268 tests\n- Added ownership suite: 4 tests\n- git diff --check\n\nAll commands exited 0. No existing tests or configuration changed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":19,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; node --version; cat package.json; rg --files -g AGENTS.md -g '*lock*' -g '*moveTo*' -g '*worker*' -g '*job*' src tests | head -90","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-bullmq-G7VJT5/4-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":5647,"stdout_bytes":12503,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file